    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert insurance document analyst specializing in Master Service Agreements (MSAs).\n\nYour task is to extract exactly 5 insurance key-value pairs from the provided MSA document text.\n\nFor each PDF, extract:\n1. Company Name - The name of the company/entity in the MSA\n2-6. Five insurance categories with their coverage amounts:\n   - Insurance Category (e.g., General Liability, Professional Liability, Workers Compensation, Auto Insurance, Umbrella Policy)\n   - Coverage Amount (the monetary value/limit for that category)\n\nReturn the data in the exact JSON schema format specified by the output parser.",
          "batching": {
            "batchSize": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "e4e050a5-ff94-4dbf-a41b-dd13e4e78a21",
      "name": "Extract Insurance Data",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -3200,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"companyName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Name of the company in the MSA\"\n    },\n    \"generalLiability\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"General Liability insurance coverage amount\"\n    },\n    \"professionalLiability\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Professional Liability insurance coverage amount\"\n    },\n    \"workersCompensation\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Workers Compensation insurance coverage amount\"\n    },\n    \"autoInsurance\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Auto Insurance coverage amount\"\n    },\n    \"umbrellaPolicy\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Umbrella Policy coverage amount\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"companyName\", \"generalLiability\", \"professionalLiability\", \"workersCompensation\", \"autoInsurance\", \"umbrellaPolicy\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "38226ac5-9f91-46e0-bdfe-68cba7da2841",
      "name": "Insurance Data Schema",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -2976,
        832
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=Today's date {{ $now }}\n\nYou are an expert insurance analyst and report writer. Use the insurance analyzer mcp client to derive insights. You can use the analyzer to answer questions like:\n\n- \"Which companies have Professional Liability below $3 million?\"\n- \"Calculate total exposure for Tech Solutions Inc.\"\n- \"Compare all companies on Professional Liability coverage\"\n- \"What's the average Professional Liability coverage?\"\n- \"Assess risk profile for Data Analytics Pro LLC\"\n- \"Show compliance check against $2M minimum Professional Liability\"\n- \"Generate executive summary of all coverage\"\n\nYour task is to create a comprehensive, professional report based on the insurance data extracted from multiple MSA documents and the mathematical calculations performed by the MCP server.\n\nThe report should include:\n\n1. Executive Summary - Brief overview of the analysis\n2. Data Overview - Summary of all companies and policies analyzed\n3. Key Metrics - Present the calculations from the MCP server\n4. Risk Assessment - Identify any coverage gaps or concerns\n5. Recommendations - Actionable insights based on the data\n\nThe report should then be created as a draft in the gmail drafter tool to send to {{$('Workflow Configuration').last().json.reportRecipientEmail}}. Ensure the text is friendly for gmail email drafts. \n\nMake the report suitable for executive review and decision-making. The output of the agent should also be the same analysis that can be stored and uploaded elsewhere."
        }
      },
      "id": "060e2fd9-321b-4b06-9dae-0c6b06bc1425",
      "name": "Generate Report",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -2160,
        640
      ]
    },
